            }
          ],
          "text": "According to Paul M. Smith (Petitioner), according to Paul M. Smith (Petitioner), the standard applied requires showing that voters are prevented from registering to vote, from raising money, from campaigning, or from showing up at the polls."
        },
        {
          "attribution": "Paul M. Smith (Petitioner)",
          "citations": [
