                "ev-3da3e7ceddf8-0000-0004"
              ],
              "pages": {
                "end": 5,
                "start": 5
              }
            }
          ],
          "text": "According to Paul M. Smith (Petitioner), according to Paul M. Smith (Petitioner), lower courts applied a \u201cshut\u2011out\u201d standard that lacks real scrutiny of the map."
        },
        {
          "attribution": "Paul M. Smith (Petitioner)",
          "citations": [
            {
              "document_hash": "3da3e7ceddf897b095422836c769a2e2e493bb6050ef6c21919ad2ad95dd0ed2",
              "evidence_ids": [
                "ev-3da3e7ceddf8-0000-0005"
              ],
              "pages": {
                "end": 6,
                "start": 6
              }
            }
          ],
          "text": "According to Paul M. Smith (Petitioner), according to Paul M. Smith (Petitioner), there are judicially enforceable limits on a state\u2019s power to create an uneven playing field in congressional elections."
        },
        {
          "attribution": "Mr. Smith",
          "citations": [
            {
              "document_hash": "3da3e7ceddf897b095422836c769a2e2e493bb6050ef6c21919ad2ad95dd0ed2",
              "evidence_ids": [
                "ev-3da3e7ceddf8-0001-0000"
              ],
              "pages": {
                "end": 19,
                "start": 19
              }
            }
          ],
          "text": "According to Mr. Smith, the government may not discriminate against people based on partisan affiliation or political viewpoint."
        },
        {
          "attribution": "Mr. Smith",
          "citations": [
            {
              "document_hash": "3da3e7ceddf897b095422836c769a2e2e493bb6050ef6c21919ad2ad95dd0ed2",
              "evidence_ids": [
                "ev-3da3e7ceddf8-0001-0002"
              ],
              "pages": {
                "end": 20,
                "start": 20
              }
            }
          ],
          "text": "According to Mr. Smith, some level of partisan consideration is permissible, but an outer boundary is needed."
        },
        {
          "attribution": "Mr. Smith",
          "citations": [
            {
              "document_hash": "3da3e7ceddf897b095422836c769a2e2e493bb6050ef6c21919ad2ad95dd0ed2",
              "evidence_ids": [
                "ev-3da3e7ceddf8-0001-0003"
              ],
              "pages": {
                "end": 23,
                "start": 23
              }
            }
          ],
          "text": "According to Mr. Smith, when one party obtains two\u2011thirds of the seats with less than half the votes, the map crosses the constitutional line."
        },
        {
          "attribution": "Cortes and Accurti",
          "citations": [
            {
              "document_hash": "3da3e7ceddf897b095422836c769a2e2e493bb6050ef6c21919ad2ad95dd0ed2",
              "evidence_ids": [
                "ev-3da3e7ceddf8-0002-0003"
              ],
              "pages": {
                "end": 45,
                "start": 45
              }
            }
          ],
          "text": "According to Cortes and Accurti, the Shaw line of cases attempted to isolate race from politics in redistricting."
        },
        {
          "attribution": "Mr. DeLone",
          "citations": [
            {
              "document_hash": "3da3e7ceddf897b095422836c769a2e2e493bb6050ef6c21919ad2ad95dd0ed2",
              "evidence_ids": [
                "ev-3da3e7ceddf8-0003-0001"
              ],
              "pages": {
                "end": 53,
                "start": 53
              }
            }
          ],
          "text": "According to Mr. DeLone, traditional districting criteria are tools used by parties to seek political advantage, which is not inherently unlawful."
        },
        {
          "attribution": "Mr. Smith",
          "citations": [
            {
              "document_hash": "3da3e7ceddf897b095422836c769a2e2e493bb6050ef6c21919ad2ad95dd0ed2",
              "evidence_ids": [
                "ev-3da3e7ceddf8-0003-0003"
              ],
              "pages": {
                "end": 57,
                "start": 57
              }
            }
          ],
          "text": "According to Mr. Smith, the map exhibits packing and cracking, a form of severe partisan discrimination."
        },
        {
          "attribution": "Mr. Smith",
          "citations": [
            {
              "document_hash": "3da3e7ceddf897b095422836c769a2e2e493bb6050ef6c21919ad2ad95dd0ed2",
              "evidence_ids": [
                "ev-3da3e7ceddf8-0003-0002"
              ],
              "pages": {
                "end": 55,
                "start": 55
              }
            }
          ],
          "text": "According to Mr. Smith, the complaint satisfies the Bandemer standard by alleging partisan maximization was the sole driving force behind the map."
